models.description:
JWT session tokens for admin authentication with access and refresh token support.

This table tracks active admin sessions with security-relevant metadata including IP address, requested URL, and referrer information. Each session is associated with an admin user and contains both access and refresh tokens for JWT-based authentication. The session expires after 30 days from last activity, with access tokens valid for 15 minutes and refresh tokens valid for 30 days.

